# {{lb|en|figuratively|in reference to curtains closing at the end of a stage show}} An [[end]] or [[death]].
#: {{coi|en|It's '''curtains''' for you!}}
#: {{ux|en|"What if a bunch of [[scuba diver]]s nosed about here?" / "'''Curtains''' for them, when our [[wikipedia:side-scan sonar|side-scan sonar]] sees them."}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial|oenology}} A [[ring]] of clear [[liquid]], forming into [[drop]]s, near the top of a [[glass]] of [[fortified]] [[wine]]; the result of [[differential]] [[evaporation]] of [[alcohol]] and subsequent changes in [[surface tension]]; an example of the {{l|en|Marangoni effect}}.
#: {{syn|en|church windows|legs|tears of wine|wine tears}}

